  "articles": [],
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "dawn-page-oem-odm",
      "slug": "oem-odm",
      "title": {
        "en": "Create your collection.",
        "zh": "定制您的系列。"
      },
      "excerpt": {
        "en": "A starting point for beauty tool design and presentation.",
        "zh": "从工具设计到外观呈现，开启定制沟通。"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "## Tell us what you are creating\nShare the tool types, desired look, target market and packaging brief. We can discuss the options and confirm technical details before any production commitment.\n\n## A clear project path\nConcept → sample brief → material and finish confirmation → production plan. Each stage depends on confirmed specifications.",
        "zh": "## 告诉我们您的构想\n请分享工具类型、目标外观、市场与包装需求。具体选项和技术细节会在生产承诺前逐项确认。\n\n## 清晰的项目路径\n概念 → 样品需求 → 材质与外观确认 → 生产计划。各阶段以实际确认的规格为准。"
      },
      "status": "published",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T05:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "dawn-page-about",
      "slug": "about",
      "title": {
        "en": "A partner for beauty ideas.",
        "zh": "让美妆构想更清晰。"
      },
      "excerpt": {
        "en": "Beauty tools and thoughtful details for your next collection.",
        "zh": "以美妆工具与细节构成您的下一套系列。"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "## Where beauty ideas begin\nExplore makeup brushes, sponges, lash tools and gift sets.\n\n## Work together\nTell us what your collection needs. Shape, feel, finish and presentation each deserve a clear brief.",
        "zh": "## 美妆构想的起点\n探索化妆刷、美妆蛋、睫毛工具与礼盒系列。\n\n## 一起推进\n分享您的系列需求，从形状、手感、外观到包装，逐步形成清晰的方案。"
      },
      "status": "published",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T05:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "dawn-page-factories",
      "slug": "factories",
      "title": {
        "en": "Inside the making.",
        "zh": "走近制作流程。"
      },
      "excerpt": {
        "en": "Explore the steps behind a beauty tool collection.",
        "zh": "了解美妆工具系列背后的制作环节。"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "## From components to finished tools\nA beauty tool project brings together material selection, component preparation, assembly, finishing and inspection.\n\n## Plan with clarity\nThe process and quality requirements are established for each product brief and sample.",
        "zh": "## 从部件到成品\n美妆工具项目涉及材质选择、部件准备、组装、外观处理与检验。\n\n## 清晰规划\n具体工序和品质要求，按产品需求及样品逐项确定。"
      },
      "status": "published",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T05:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "dawn-page-research",
      "slug": "research",
      "title": {
        "en": "Care in every detail.",
        "zh": "关注每一处细节。"
      },
      "excerpt": {
        "en": "Explore material, sample and inspection questions for beauty tools.",
        "zh": "了解美妆工具的材质、打样及检验问题。"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "## Material and feel\nBrush fibers, handle finish, ferrules, sponge texture and tool geometry shape the experience of each tool.\n\n## Quality by design\nAgree samples, acceptance criteria and relevant documentation before production.",
        "zh": "## 材质与手感\n刷毛、刷柄表面、金属口管、美妆蛋质地与工具结构，共同决定使用体验。\n\n## 从设计考虑品质\n生产前明确样品、验收标准与所需文件。"
      },
      "status": "published",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T05:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "dawn-page-privacy",
      "slug": "privacy",
      "title": {
        "en": "Inquiry privacy",
        "zh": "询盘隐私"
      },
      "excerpt": {
        "en": "How inquiry information is used.",
        "zh": "询盘信息的使用说明。"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "## Inquiry data\nThe form collects the information you choose to submit so the team can respond to your project request.",
        "zh": "## 询盘信息\n表单收集您主动提交的信息，用于回复项目需求。"
      },
      "status": "published",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T05:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
